{'symbol': 'TT', 'date': '2022-01-31 06:30:00', 'title': 'TRANE TECHNOLOGIES REPORTS STRONG FOURTH-QUARTER AND FULL-YEAR 2021 RESULTS; BEGINS 2022 WITH RECORD BACKLOG', 'text': 'SWORDS, IRELAND--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TRANE TECHNOLOGIES PLC (NYSE:TT), A GLOBAL CLIMATE INNOVATOR, TODAY REPORTED DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE (EPS) FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS OF $1.35 FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2021. ADJUSTED CONTINUING EPS WAS $1.36, UP 32 PERCENT, WHICH EXCLUDES $11.2 MILLION RELATED TO PLANNED RESTRUCTURING AND TRANSFORMATION COSTS OFFSET BY THE RELEASE OF A PENSION INDEMNIFICATION. FOURTH-QUARTER 2021 RESULTS FINANCIAL COMPARISONS - FOURTH-QUARTER CONTINUING OPERATIONS $, MILLIO'}